	(text "5V rail (+5V):\n  JP1 fitted: BBB VDD_5V (P9.5/6) joins the rail\n  A) external 5V on J11 powers the BBB: fit JP1,\n     and do NOT plug the BBB's own supply\n  B) the BBB powers the modules: fit JP1, leave J11 empty\n  (a BBB on USB only has no VDD_5V)\n3V3 rail (+3V3), from the BBB only:\n  JP3 fitted: BBB 3V3 (P9.3/4) joins the rail"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 650 42 0)
